<div class="section_content content" id="7681937_content" title-footnotes="0"><div class="para">Any person or persons jointly or severally aggrieved by any final order of the Chief Officer of the Bureau may appeal to the Board of Zoning Appeals.</div><div class="footnotes"></div></div>                </article>
